 get back up.Down finisher. You can now finish a downed enemy by clicking around him when he is fallen. This will instantly neutralize that enemy. Added DLSS frame generation. Improved certain sound effects (","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T10:38:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199306699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3863050-1833334318566168","game_id":"steam-3863050","kind":"announcement","title":"Exiting news for your Wallachian RPG of Choice!","summary":"Full Patch Note Details Apart from optimizations, we've also taken to improve the quality of life and the smaller, yet noticeable visual and collision problems. Here is a list of improvements that has reached the current version of our demo : Additions :Added FSR Frame GenerationModified the inventory to be able to use items with the interact button and added a Text Hint about it.Fire throughout the level will damage the player. Fixes : Fixed Tent collision issues.Fixed bugged field of view refr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-20T12:33:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318566168","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3863050-1832065502821509","game_id":"steam-3863050","kind":"announcement","title":"Addressing Demo Feedback","summary":"Patch Notes :Additions :Updated end Animation with effectsDragon Fire AttackRedesigned an area to handle NPC navigationCreated system for future Main City mesh optimizationsAdded some more items.Bug Fixes : Fixed bug where Recipes were not being saved.Fixed fire resolution bugFixed low volume NPC voiceFixed Tent collisionMade a certain NPC non damageableFixed bug where pressing Escape was not closing the inventory, journal or equipment screen.Fixed Bear view angle.Fixed clickable inventory icon.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-11T14:44:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502821509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3863050-1832065502815809","game_id":"steam-3863050","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Demo is OUT!","summary":"We have been showcased on the mighty IGN! We would like to thank everyone for the kind words all over social media! Our project has come a long ways since its inception, a simple idea about a monster hunter in the medieval times of our dear Transylvania. We're proud to release our Demo, and we plan to keep moving forward with more monsters, epic weapons, stories and folk music!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T17:02:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502815809","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3863050-1828894815561078","game_id":"steam-3863050","kind":"announcement","title":"Short combat showcase","summary":"Everything's been improved since older showcases, from the A.I. of the enemies, to the visuals and the feel of the swordplay. There is a lot left to be done, but we are on the right track! See you on the next showcase and thank you for following us!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-03T18:46:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815561078","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3863050":{"la